comment.narrative:
65.5% of surveyed beneficiaries (358 out of 546) reported that they will continue either their Income- IGA and/or agricultural activities, and that their income was sufficient to cover their basic needs:
•	175 out of 293 Mothers' Club members;
•	43 out of 49 cash beneficiaries;
•	140 out of 204 farmers.

47.2% of surveyed beneficiaries (258 out of 546) reported having participated to at least 3 sensitization campaigns:
•	197 out of 293 Mothers' Club members;
•	5 out of 49 cash beneficiaries;
•	56 out of 204 farmers.
